    "body": "Your quoted text doesn't mention the length of a local part or an entire address. It mentions only weird styles of local parts or domains that are difficult or impossible to be dealt with relatively simple regex without failing into ReDoS. It's _much_ easier to introduce the length limits of a local part (or an entire address).",
